This distribution is a modified fork of DBX (https://github.com/t8y2/dbx).

Modifications from the original work:

  - Added a "TSV with comments" data-grid copy format, which prefixes a copied
    TSV with the table name and comment, the column comments and the column
    names.
  - Changed the auto-update source, public key and release pipeline so updates
    are served from this fork's own releases instead of the upstream project's.

